00:06:27.567 --> 00:06:31.600
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:06:32.199 --> 00:06:38.295
<v Slow>ジャガーの双子の赤ちゃんは、いつ生まれましたか。

00:06:39.096 --> 00:06:43.391
<v Host>On June sixteenth this year, at Tobe Zoo in Ehime Prefecture.

00:06:43.992 --> 00:06:48.983
<v Slow>女の子の体は、何色ですか。

00:06:49.783 --> 00:06:53.576
<v Host>It is yellow with black markings, just like her father.

00:06:54.175 --> 00:06:59.648
<v Slow>2匹の名前は、どうやって決まりますか。

00:07:00.447 --> 00:07:05.752
<v Host>By a visitor vote. The zoo is collecting name ideas until September sixth.

00:07:06.351 --> 00:07:14.512
<v Host>That's all for today. If you visit Ehime, you can meet the twins — and even help choose their names. See you next time!

00:07:15.112 --> 00:07:17.512
<v News>また明日。
